      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "王明，我想确认一下今天的任务顺序。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk2_sc002_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "可以。你现在有哪几件事？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk2_sc002_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "先整理资料，然后检查昨天的结果。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk2_sc002_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "还有下午要发的邮件，对吧？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk2_sc002_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "对。我不知道哪一件最重要。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk2_sc002_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "我建议先检查结果，因为别人还在等。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk2_sc002_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "有道理。那资料可以晚一点儿整理。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk2_sc002_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "对，邮件最好午饭以后写。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk2_sc002_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "这样我上午就只做两件事。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk2_sc002_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "任务太多的时候，先分清轻重比较好。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk2_sc002_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "以前我总想一起做，结果更慢。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk2_sc002_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "我以前也这样。后来我开始写简单的清单。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "file": "hsk2_sc002_line_013.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "每天都写吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "file": "hsk2_sc002_line_014.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "忙的时候写，不忙的时候不用。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "file": "hsk2_sc002_line_015.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "听起来很实用。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "file": "hsk2_sc002_line_016.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "你可以试一个星期，看看适不适合你。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "file": "hsk2_sc002_line_017.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "好，我今天就开始。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "file": "hsk2_sc002_line_018.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "行，有变化我们下午再调整。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
